# Local overrides for `npm run dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored).
#
# Nothing here is required to run Sentinel locally: `npm run dev` boots with
# remote bindings off, and the judged rules report themselves as degraded.
#
# These two are only needed by the eval harness in --live / --record mode,
# which calls Workers AI over the REST API from Node rather than through the
# `AI` binding. Create a token with the "Workers AI: Read" permission at
# https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
#
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
